@tool
class_name TransvoxelTables
extends RefCounted
## Transition cell tables from Eric Lengyel's Transvoxel Algorithm (transvoxel.org,
## github.com/EricLengyel/Transvoxel), flattened for GDScript and the GPU shaders. The
## regular cell tables are in [MarchingCubesTables].
##
## A transition cell sits on a face of a chunk next to a chunk of twice its resolution. Its
## nine full-resolution samples (on the face, half a cell apart) and four half-resolution
## ones (the cell's own corners, moved [member MesherGrid.transition_width] of a cell into the
## chunk) are numbered in face coordinates (u right, v up):
##   6 7 8      B . C
##   3 4 5      . . .
##   0 1 2      9 . A
## Samples 9-C hold the same values as 0, 2, 6 and 8.
